  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.9.8 is a breaking SDK/QQ contract migration: scoped user identities and channel-scoped message references, opaque string IDs, unified QQ group APIs, cancellable operations, explicit batch outcomes, unknown values and three-state updates. Adds common Markdown, buttons/interactions, cards with explicit fallbacks, target message capabilities and optional reactions. Rebuild plugins and adapters. ABI: SDK 1.0.0.0, QQ Model 1.0.0.0, Discord Model 0.9.0.0, Telegram Model 0.9.0.0; ShiroBot API 0.9.2.",
